{"title":"Commutator (ring)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ring\" title=\"Ring\">ring</a>, the <b>commutator</b> of two elements <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, denoted <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecbd1ba3da8f2adef66a63f2ab32c47e63fa734.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />, is the quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be50c3dec0dbf615e12f7d98e1cac7c364737432.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab-ba$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />.  It can be seen as a measure of the failure of the ring to be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Commutative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commutative\">commutative</a>; in a commutative ring, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d72a1f32c0ffc7bf1919c3cc45424b39c2009e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[a,b]=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />.  The same definition applies for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Field\" title=\"Field\">fields</a>.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Commutator_(ring)&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Commutator_(ring)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Commutator_(group)\" title=\"Commutator (group)\">Commutator (group)</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018080928\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 292/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 869/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.356      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.356      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6932:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018080928 and revision id 26167. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}